Error: Jet.TypestateUnknownState: `Gone` is not a declared state of `Crate`
  --> Tests/UI/Typestate/unknown_transition_from_state_is_e0151.jet:4:22
    |
  4 |     fill: fn(self: ^^Crate.Gone) -[]> Crate.Full { return self }
    |                      ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Typestate: `Crate: struct { state { … } }` defines the valid state labels; `Gone` is not among them — a typo here would silently create a phantom state that no transition reaches
 Fix: Add `Gone` inside `Crate: struct { state { … } }`, or correct the spelling
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.TypestateUnknownState
